{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_phase_b", "label": "Phase B: per-request user-scoped Supabase client", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "RLS policies from migrations 001/002 were inert because the service-role key bypasses RLS; Phase B mints a per-request user JWT so the policies actually filter queries."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_contextvar_dal_pattern", "label": "ContextVar DAL pattern (_client() / _current_client)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chosen over explicit-parameter or class refactors: endpoint sweep is mechanical, call-site cost is one Depends(authed); misuse falls through to a clearly named _sb_service, backed by a CI grep-lint and integration tests. The _session_only_ctx escape hatch was dropped as a footgun."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_authed_dependency", "label": "authed() yield dependency", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hard-fails with 401 if user_id/company_id/role missing (no empty-string fallback, which would break the UUID cast in policies). StreamingResponse banned because the contextvar reset fires before a generator yields."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_admin_authed", "label": "admin_authed / super_admin_authed", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_jwt_design", "label": "Supabase user JWT design (role=authenticated, app_role)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PostgREST consumes the `role` claim via SET LOCAL ROLE, so the app-level role moves to `app_role`; TTL is 30 min because /memory/refresh-* can run 3+ minutes and the JWT never leaves the server."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_mint_user_jwt", "label": "mint_user_jwt (auth_jwt.py)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_make_user_client", "label": "make_user_client (anon key + Bearer JWT)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Builds a fresh httpx client per request; if staging shows >50ms p95, fall back to a pooled Client with postgrest.auth(jwt) rebinding, after a spike confirming the rebind on supabase==2.28.3."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_sb_service_client", "label": "_sb_service (service-role client)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_storage_service_role_carveout", "label": "Storage stays on service-role (path-prefix isolation)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No storage.objects RLS policies exist, so user-client storage calls would be denied; tenant isolation continues via {company_id}/ path prefix. Storage RLS deferred to a future batch."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_migration_003a", "label": "Migration 003a: rename role -> app_role in 8 policies", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Required because reusing `role` collides with PostgREST's SET LOCAL ROLE. Not rolled back on code rollback: app_role policies still work under service-role."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_migration_003_change_own_password", "label": "Migration 003: change_own_password SECURITY DEFINER RPC", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "RLS has no column-level granularity, so a normal user cannot UPDATE their own password_hash; SECURITY DEFINER with SET search_path guards against search-path privilege escalation; bcrypt/argon2 prefix regex catches a plaintext being passed."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_cookie_name_bump", "label": "Session cookie bump is_session -> is_session_v2", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SECRET_KEY persists across deploys (sync: false in render.yaml), so bumping the cookie name is the reliable way to force re-login with the full ctx fields; all other cookie settings preserved verbatim."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_check_no_raw_sb_lint", "label": "CI lint: no raw db.sb.* / require_auth / inline request.session", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Backward-compat db.sb shim removed because it preserved an RLS-bypass surface invisible to the endpoint sweep."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_api_change_password", "label": "api_change_password endpoint", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Self-change goes through the RPC; admin resetting a super_admin returns an explicit 403 instead of the silent 0-row no-op caused by migration 002's role clamp."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_api_me", "label": "api_me endpoint (GET /api/me)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_api_logout", "label": "api_logout (intentionally session-only)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Adding Depends(authed) would prevent a user with a stale/invalid session from logging out cleanly."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_queue_worker_service_role", "label": "Queue worker stays on service-role", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The worker thread starts at module load with no contextvar set, so _client() falls back to _sb_service; a request-time JWT would be expired by the time a job runs. Contract: no DB-touching threads spawned from request handlers."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_staging_gates", "label": "Staging gates (JWT shape, storage, TTL, perf)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_deploy_and_rollback_plan", "label": "Phase B deploy order and rollback", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Migrations 003a then 003 first (safe under service-role), then Render secrets, then a single code push; rollback is git revert since service-role bypasses RLS."}, {"id": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_rls_policies", "label": "RLS policies (001_enable_rls + 002_role_clamp_fix)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_phase_b", "target": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_contextvar_dal_pattern", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_phase_b", "target": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_authed_dependency", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_phase_b", "target": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_jwt_design", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_phase_b", "target": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_migration_003a", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_phase_b", "target": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_migration_003_change_own_password", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/archive/PHASE_B_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_archive_phase_b_plan_phase_b", "target": "docs_archive_phase_b_